Subject: [PATCH] i2c: mediatek: support MT6765 AP channels

Separate AP transfers from shared initialization and recovery. Configure
shadow mode through secure firmware, balance setup/resume failures and
select the stock channel identities. Enable experimental r1 touch probing.

---
